<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mi Perfil - MiUni - Project</title>
    
    <!-- Hoja de estilos global -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    
    <!-- Iconos Boxicons -->
    <link href='https://unpkg.com/boxicons@2.1.4/css/boxicons.min.css' rel='stylesheet'>
    
    <style>
        :root {
            {{#isAdmin}}
            --primary: #8b5cf6;
            --primary-glow: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);
            --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9 0%, #8b5cf6 100%);
            --primary-gradient-hover: linear-gradient(135deg, #5b21b6 0%, #6d28d9 100%);
            {{/isAdmin}}
            {{#isProfesor}}
            --primary: #10b981;
            --primary-glow: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
            --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #047857 0%, #10b981 100%);
            --primary-gradient-hover: linear-gradient(135deg, #065f46 0%, #047857 100%);
            {{/isProfesor}}
            {{#isAlumno}}
            --primary: #3b82f6;
            --primary-glow: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
            --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
            --primary-gradient-hover: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            {{/isAlumno}}
        }
        
        body {
            background-image: 
                {{#isAdmin}}radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12) 0px, transparent 50%),{{/isAdmin}}
                {{#isProfesor}}radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12) 0px, transparent 50%),{{/isProfesor}}
                {{#isAlumno}}radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12) 0px, transparent 50%),{{/isAlumno}}
                radial-gradient(at 100% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%);
        }

        .profile-card {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
        }

        .profile-avatar {
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--primary-glow);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .profile-avatar:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px var(--primary-glow);
        }

        .profile-avatar i {
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .profile-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
        }

        .profile-role {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            padding: 0.45rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1.25rem;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding-top: 2rem;
        }

        .info-item {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .info-item:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-color: var(--border-hover);
        }

        .info-label {
            font-size: 0.725rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .info-value {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .no-persona-alert {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
            border: 1px dashed var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .info-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Navegación con icono de flecha hacia atrás -->
        <nav class="nav">
            <a href="{{backUrl}}"><i class='bx bx-arrow-back'></i> Volver al Dashboard</a>
        </nav>
        
        <!-- Panel de Perfil con estilo glassmorphism -->
        <div class="glass-panel profile-card">
            
            <!-- Avatar grande estético -->
            <div class="profile-avatar">
                <i class='bx bx-user'></i>
            </div>
            
            <h2 class="profile-title">{{username}}</h2>
            <div class="profile-role">
                <i class='bx bx-shield-quarter'></i>
                <span>{{tipo_usuario}}</span>
            </div>
            
            {{#persona}}
            <!-- Grilla de información personal -->
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Nombre completo</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{nombre}} {{apellido}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Documento (DNI)</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{dni}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Correo Electrónico</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{correo}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Teléfono</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{#telefono}}{{telefono}}{{/telefono}}{{^telefono}}<em>No especificado</em>{{/telefono}}</div>
                </div>
                {{#legajo}}
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Legajo</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{legajo}}</div>
                </div>
                {{/legajo}}
                {{#tipo_alumno}}
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Tipo de Alumno</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{tipo_alumno}}</div>
                </div>
                {{/tipo_alumno}}
            </div>
            {{/persona}}
            
            {{^persona}}
            <div class="no-persona-alert">
                <i class='bx bx-info-circle' style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: block; color: var(--primary);"></i>
                No se encontraron datos personales vinculados a tu usuario. Contacta a la administración de la facultad para asociar tu legajo.
            </div>
            {{/persona}}
            
            <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <a href="{{backUrl}}" class="btn btn-secondary">
                    <i class='bx bx-chevron-left'></i> Volver
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
